---
description: Decide field-level findings for designVisitorPaths.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Organize the exhibition into zones and visitor paths that support the argument and audience needs. Offer multiple levels of engagement, preserve accessibility and conservation constraints, and use exact space and flow services for feasibility checks. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
